            {
                "entry_id": "a43f9847-1501-3182-a38b-c3fdfa36514f",
                "word": "suspense",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6558345a-ef88-44ce-a7c1-1d9074690219",
                        "entry_id": "a43f9847-1501-3182-a38b-c3fdfa36514f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "suspenses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "056b7a77-3f37-3fe0-8185-599b7d6b7ecf",
                        "entry_id": "a43f9847-1501-3182-a38b-c3fdfa36514f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Attente anxieuse ; doute sur la suite du déroulement de l’histoire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e2a4acf-afb8-4a7a-b930-436fad61cc73",
                                "sense_id": "056b7a77-3f37-3fe0-8185-599b7d6b7ecf",
                                "text": "L’analyse plus approfondie de la notion de distance esthétique permet de revenir sur le rôle primordial du suspense et de l’angoisse dans le processus narratif d’un récit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68a13671-6d06-46f0-9888-b7487ae176d0",
                                "sense_id": "056b7a77-3f37-3fe0-8185-599b7d6b7ecf",
                                "text": "Nous pouvons dire que le suspense est l’aboutissement d’une intense tension dramatique, sorte de condensation du récit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d846002-ea35-4cec-8a67-c6811f5e14fa",
                                "sense_id": "056b7a77-3f37-3fe0-8185-599b7d6b7ecf",
                                "text": "Le premier correspond à l’intrigue, dans laquelle on se laisse entraîner d’autant plus facilement que la feuilletonisation du récit est parfaitement maîtrisée grâce à un découpage et un rythme qui ménagent suspense, dévoilements et rebondissements."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d4038804-32a5-42bd-86d3-d94cba198709",
                                "sense_id": "056b7a77-3f37-3fe0-8185-599b7d6b7ecf",
                                "text": "Ben, un pauvre qui retire de l’argent à la tirette de la carte bleue, il ne sait jamais si ça va marcher... Suspense !"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce1ae689-491d-4445-b9fa-6a84e6ec66f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "a43f9847-1501-3182-a38b-c3fdfa36514f",
                        "source_sense_id": "056b7a77-3f37-3fe0-8185-599b7d6b7ecf",
                        "target_lang_word": "Suspense",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "19c2c507-12ac-427c-83f3-41bc3d378aa3",
                        "source_entry_id": "a43f9847-1501-3182-a38b-c3fdfa36514f",
                        "source_sense_id": "056b7a77-3f37-3fe0-8185-599b7d6b7ecf",
                        "target_lang_word": "suspense",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "suspense",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61e7d0b5-5a77-3bb1-9deb-ce079a577192",
                                        "entry_id": "b73e4c8f-2acf-37ea-b1d3-e0c310424001",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being suspended; cessation for a time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b938d9bd-b788-40a5-8f56-682e7ce4f901",
                                                "sense_id": "61e7d0b5-5a77-3bb1-9deb-ce079a577192",
                                                "text": "For thee the Fates, severely kind, ordain / A cool suspense from pleasure and from pain; / Thy life a long dead calm of fix'd repose; / No pulse that riots, and no blood that glows."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a150fdfc-ea35-3fe7-8cc0-eea88baaeefa",
                                        "entry_id": "b73e4c8f-2acf-37ea-b1d3-e0c310424001",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "the pleasurable emotion of anticipation and excitement regarding the outcome or climax of a book, film etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16ad565e-1e64-3c90-8568-3feeff639628",
                                        "entry_id": "b73e4c8f-2acf-37ea-b1d3-e0c310424001",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The unpleasant emotion of anxiety or apprehension in an uncertain situation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "618b38d1-d053-412a-afa9-8f855a4c9137",
                                                "sense_id": "16ad565e-1e64-3c90-8568-3feeff639628",
                                                "text": "Ten days the prophet in suspense remain'd."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb398e93-dbfd-46f8-aed3-fbe16d415ece",
                                                "sense_id": "16ad565e-1e64-3c90-8568-3feeff639628",
                                                "text": "I believe that, to the young, suspense is the most intolerable suffering. Active misery always brings with it its own power of endurance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38f6fac0-af10-35c8-a645-b612cbe9118c",
                                        "entry_id": "b73e4c8f-2acf-37ea-b1d3-e0c310424001",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A temporary cessation of one's right; suspension, as when the rent or other profits of land cease by unity of possession of land and rent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "386e27c2-7b95-3de8-85dc-40063ebe97de",
                                        "entry_id": "b73e4c8f-2acf-37ea-b1d3-e0c310424001",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A deadline."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "274dd70b-4926-44d4-9494-18500d7a39e3",
                                                "sense_id": "386e27c2-7b95-3de8-85dc-40063ebe97de",
                                                "text": "She sent us that assignment with a suspense of noon tomorrow."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "suspense",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab34b790-9a97-303b-8100-545db9acb4b2",
